# news-agent schedules, run by supercronic in the `cron` container.
# Times follow the container's TZ env var (set it in docker-compose / .env).
# Mirrors the macOS launchd cadences this replaces.
#
#  min hour dom mon dow   command
    0   10   *   *   *     news-agent run --cadence daily
    0   *    *   *   *     news-agent run --cadence priority
    0   10   *   *   0     news-agent run --cadence weekly
    0   9    *   *   *     news-agent backup
